{"lang":"as","lot":2,"out":[{"pack":"humor","key":"break_ice","register":"neutral","fr":"Pour briser la glace, je vous offre un café ?","text":"কথা আৰম্ভ কৰিবলৈ, মই আপোনাক এটা কফি খুৱাব পাৰোনে?","back":"Pour commencer la conversation, puis-je vous offrir un café ?","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"just_kidding","register":"informal","fr":"Je plaisante, bien sûr !","text":"নিশ্চয়, মই ধেমালি কৰিছিলোঁ!","back":"Bien sûr, je plaisantais !","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"ironic","fr":"Génial, on est lundi…","text":"বাঃ, আজি সোমবাৰ…","back":"Eh bien, aujourd'hui c'est lundi…","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"neutral_meaning","fr":"Je n'aime pas les lundis.","text":"মই সোমবাৰ ভাল নাপাওঁ।","back":"Je n'aime pas le lundi.","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"}]}